{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "13122893-b3ec-8a80-b6c9-fa25f62b5f01",
  "created_at": "2026-02-25T14:22:13-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Tariq Cohen",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T14:20:38-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T14:20:40-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good afternoon, Denise, and I hope you are having a pleasant Wednesday. My name is Tariq Cohen. Thank you very much for taking my call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T14:20:49-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, Mr. Cohen. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T14:20:53-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I manage a property here, and since last weekend's nor'easter, Saturday into Sunday, the edge of the road has been crumbling. It is at the curve. I have to say, it is quite a nuisance."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T14:21:05-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so the pavement edge is breaking up at a curve. How big are we talking?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T14:21:11-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "About two feet across, I would say. Maybe a little more at the widest part. Cars are swinging out to avoid it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T14:21:19-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. And where is this exactly?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T14:21:22-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is at 204 Harrison Avenue, on the Fort Adams side. Please, one moment. I am on hold on another line, and I may get a click. Forgive me if that happens."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T14:21:33-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, take your time. I'll put it in for the road crew to look at."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T14:21:39-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You are very kind. May I ask how long repairs usually take? Is it days, or weeks?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T14:21:45-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Honestly it varies. After a storm they've got a long list, so it could be a few days or it could be longer. They'll look at it and prioritize."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T14:21:55-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see. Longer, then. Well, that is a little disappointing, but I understand."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T14:22:00-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I know. Do you want a call back at the number I see here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T14:22:05-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please, 401-555-0196. Oh, there is the click. I must go. Thank you, Denise, and God bless."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T14:22:11-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, take care, Mr. Cohen."
    }
  ],
